# devices/shennong/drivers/audio/conf: the speakers of the Xiaomi 14 Pro (SM8650).
# Provides the same hakios_speaker_* interface the sound driver calls (HAKIOS_SOUND requires a
# speaker driver; the checker accepts SPEAKER_S in its place: tools/hakios-config.py).
# default n: it replaces the common SPEAKER (same interface), so it is built only where a
# defconfig names it (shennong.config); every other phone would carry it and never use it.

driver SPEAKER_S
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.speaker_shennong.c
	default n
	help    the speakers: WCD939x codec + WSA macros over SoundWire behind the LPASS audio DSP
	help    (sound=N). The reference phone has two I2C amplifiers (HAKIOS_SPEAKER) instead
